  "strength": {
    "intro": "Three sessions a week at 08:30, paired with bike days (Mon Push, Wed Pull, Fri Legs). Built around your knee: posterior-chain bias (glutes/hamstrings) for climbing power and joint stability, controlled range, no impact or deep loaded knee flexion. Warm-up 8-10 min every session: easy bike/row + glute-bridge x15, band face-pulls x15, leg swings. Lift tempo controlled (about 2s down, 1s up); no grinding reps. Stop any movement that pinches or sharply hurts the knee and clear the leg day with your physio first.",
    "progression": "Progression: when you hit the TOP of the rep range on every set with 1-2 reps still in the tank, add a little load next week (upper body ~2.5 kg, hinge/glute ~5 kg). In hard bike weeks keep strength at RPE 7-8 and don't chase PRs - it supports the riding, it doesn't compete with it. In taper (W13-14) cut strength volume ~40% and stop heavy lifting 5 days before the goal Saturday.",
    "avoid": [
      "Deep / loaded squats below parallel",
      "Heavy seated leg extension (knee shear)",
      "Jumping / plyometrics / box jumps",
      "Lunging into deep knee flexion under load",
      "Anything that pinches or sharply hurts the knee - swap it or skip it"
    ],
    "days": [
      {
        "title": "Monday - PUSH (upper)",
        "ex": [
          {
            "n": "Incline DB press",
            "sr": "4 x 8-10",
            "load": "RPE 8 - rest 2-3 min",
            "note": "Chest/shoulders. Full ROM, controlled."
          },
          {
            "n": "Standing overhead press",
            "sr": "3 x 6-8",
            "load": "RPE 8 - rest 2-3 min",
            "note": "Brace core, no lower-back arch."
          },
          {
            "n": "Flat machine / DB press",
            "sr": "3 x 10-12",
            "load": "RPE 8 - rest 90s",
            "note": "Pump, controlled tempo."
          },
          {
            "n": "Lateral raises",
            "sr": "3 x 12-15",
            "load": "RPE 9 - rest 60s",
            "note": "Light, strict, no swing."
          },
          {
            "n": "Triceps rope pushdown",
            "sr": "3 x 12-15",
            "load": "RPE 9 - rest 60s",
            "note": "Full lockout."
          },
          {
            "n": "Plank + side plank",
            "sr": "3 x 30-45s each",
            "load": "bodyweight - rest 45s",
            "note": "Core for a stable climbing posture."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Wednesday - PULL (upper) + core",
        "ex": [
